              <p class="text-[11px] text-[var(--rc-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed font-medium">
                The ATS score is calculated across four key categories with strict influence limits: Keywords (up to 40%, covering exact terms and multi-word phrases), Skills alignment (up to 30%, prioritizing required skills over preferred ones), Experience relevance (up to 20%, evaluating duration, seniority matching, and bullet point impact metrics), and Structure (up to 10%, checking sections, length, and format compatibility).
              </p>
